508 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 925 0 R
/E (When modeling data, blank nodes can function similarly to arrays or storage locations, grouping related properties without the need for explicit identifiers. The object of the property relation \(e.g, brick:ratedPowerInput\) becomes a blank node, we assign the related properties \(e.g., brick:hasUnit, brick:value\) to the blanknode \(a placeholder\).)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [12 13]
>>
endobj
